  "title": "Relay Bastions",
  "rules": [
    "Two teams of two contest three nodes; the center pays twice the outer nodes.",
    "Attune within one tile. Operational opponents within one tile block progress and payment.",
    "Only meter +3 or -3 is owned. Partial counter-attunement makes a node neutral.",
    "Pulses spend one shared cell, selecting nearest eligible enemy on a clear cardinal ray of at most three tiles.",
    "Hits resolve simultaneously. Cover, brace and a live support shield each absorb one hit that tick.",
    "A disabling tag restores integrity to three and disables the next three decisions; the body remains an obstacle.",
    "Support reaches a teammate within two tiles and lasts two ticks. Home recovery adds two cells, capped at eight.",
    "Nodes pay every fourth tick. Twelve points ends naturally; horizon 96 otherwise truncates."
  ],
